  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Thread shrimp onto skewers, leaving a little space between each shrimp.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together cumin, coriander, garlic, salt, black pepper, and paprika.",
    "Brush the shrimp with olive oil and sprinkle with the spice mixture.",
    "Grill the shrimp for 2-3 minutes per side, or until they are pink and cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, grill the pita bread for 1-2 minutes on each side, or until it is lightly toasted.",
    "Serve the shrimp skewers with grilled pita bread and a squeeze of lemon juice."
